{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-client/ui"},{"type":"text","value":". Do not import it from the main client entry."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The subpath gives you:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"selectChatUI"},{"type":"text","value":" to match tool results and split list vs inline interrupts"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"partTypeToKey"},{"type":"text","value":" to turn "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tool-call"},{"type":"text","value":" into "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolCall"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option types for tools, generic interrupts, and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"outputSchema"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your adapter owns:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Native components and context"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Native reactivity"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render callbacks, slots, or snippets"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Development warnings for missing mapped keys"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Do not add default markup. Do not add a new store. The app owns "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useAppChat"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createChatHook"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createChat"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"selectChatUI({ messages, interrupts, inlineToolNames })"},{"type":"text","value":". Automatic traversal skips a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tool-result"},{"type":"text","value":" only when "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"matched"},{"type":"text","value":" is true. Keep unmatched results."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Warn once per missing runtime key in development. Each build tool detects development mode differently, so the adapter prints the warning."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./react","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"./solid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"./vue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"./svelte","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte"}]},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"link","href":"./remix","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remix"}]},{"type":"text","value":" adapters for the public names to match: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chat"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Provider"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Messages"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Message"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Part"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Interrupts"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Interrupt"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChatContext"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createChatHookContexts"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nImport `@tanstack/ai-client/ui`. Do not import it from the main client entry.\n\nThe subpath gives you:\n\n1. `selectChatUI` to match tool results and split list vs inline interrupts\n2. `partTypeToKey` to turn `tool-call` into `toolCall`\n3. Option types for tools, generic interrupts, and `outputSchema`\n\nYour adapter owns:\n\n1. Native components and context\n2. Native reactivity\n3. Render callbacks, slots, or snippets\n4. Development warnings for missing mapped keys\n\nDo not add default markup. Do not add a new store. The app owns `useAppChat` from `createChatHook`, or `useChat` / `createChat`.\n\nCall `selectChatUI({ messages, interrupts, inlineToolNames })`. Automatic traversal skips a `tool-result` only when `matched` is true. Keep unmatched results.\n\nWarn once per missing runtime key in development. Each build tool detects development mode differently, so the adapter prints the warning.\n\nSee the [React](./react), [Solid](./solid), [Vue](./vue), [Svelte](./svelte), and [Remix](./remix) adapters for the public names to match: `Chat`, `Provider`, `Messages`, `Message`, `Part`, `Interrupts`, `Interrupt`, `useChatContext`, and `createChatHookContexts`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Custom Chat UI Adapters\nid: typed-headless-ui-custom-adapters\norder: 5\ndescription: \"Build a framework adapter on @tanstack/ai-client/ui. The core is types and selectors only.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - createChatUI\n  - custom adapter\n  - headless ui\n---\n\nImport `@tanstack/ai-client/ui`. Do not import it from the main client entry.\n\nThe subpath gives you:\n\n1. `selectChatUI` to match tool results and split list vs inline interrupts\n2. `partTypeToKey` to turn `tool-call` into `toolCall`\n3. Option types for tools, generic interrupts, and `outputSchema`\n\nYour adapter owns:\n\n1. Native components and context\n2. Native reactivity\n3. Render callbacks, slots, or snippets\n4. Development warnings for missing mapped keys\n\nDo not add default markup. Do not add a new store. The app owns `useAppChat` from `createChatHook`, or `useChat` / `createChat`.\n\nCall `selectChatUI({ messages, interrupts, inlineToolNames })`. Automatic traversal skips a `tool-result` only when `matched` is true. Keep unmatched results.\n\nWarn once per missing runtime key in development. Each build tool detects development mode differently, so the adapter prints the warning.\n\nSee the [React](./react), [Solid](./solid), [Vue](./vue), [Svelte](./svelte), and [Remix](./remix) adapters for the public names to match: `Chat`, `Provider`, `Messages`, `Message`, `Part`, `Interrupts`, `Interrupt`, `useChatContext`, and `createChatHookContexts`.\n"}
